        11/3/71                                                       DF (I)


NAME              df -- disk free

SYNOPSIS          df [ filesystem ]

DESCRIPTION       prints out the number of free blocks available on a file
                  system. If the file system is unspecified, the free space
                  on /dev/rf0 and /dev/rk0 is printed.
FILES             /dev/rf0, /dev/rk0

SEE ALSO          check

